  'Linnaeus, 1766. IUCN lists it among 100 worst invasive species globally.','LC','Hundreds of millions; expanding fast',
  'Length 23 cm; wingspan ~36 cm',23,0.12,'Omnivore',
  ARRAY['Insects','Fruit','Kitchen scraps','Eggs','Nectar'],'Walks rather than hops; follows cattle and traffic for flushed insects.',
